Description: fix noise texture unit, event loop, V-Sync and shutdown
 * 07_toggle-fullscreen bound the output texture on unit 7 just before
   uploading the noise texture, so the noise ended up on unit 7 and unit 0
   (S[0], used by the shaders for camera shake, light jitter, emissive
   spots and surface detail) had no texture: keep the noise on unit 0 and
   only pass the 7 samplers declared by the shader.
 * process every pending SDL event each frame instead of reading one
   (possibly uninitialized) event.
 * enable V-Sync after the GL context creation.
 * close audio and call SDL_Quit on exit, remove an unused variable.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
